#DESCRIPTION
Photoproduction of a Chamberlain corona (Mixed profile, next to an exponential
component without ionization) with the optical depth on: transparent, so only
the geometric shadow of the planet behind it is dark. The production must match
the integral of the corona over the box outside the body and the shadow.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#GEOMETRY
-4.0                    xMin
 4.0                    xMax
-4.0                    yMin
 4.0                    yMax
-4.0                    zMin
 4.0                    zMax

#NCELL
24                      nCellX
24                      nCellY
24                      nCellZ

#MAXBLOCKSIZE
8                       maxBlockSizeX
8                       maxBlockSizeY
8                       maxBlockSizeZ

#PERIODICITY
F                       isPeriodicX
F                       isPeriodicY
F                       isPeriodicZ

#NORMALIZATION
1.0e5                   lNormSI
1.0e5                   uNormSI

#BODY
sphere                  type
1.5                     radius
0.0                     center x
0.0                     center y
0.0                     center z

#BODYBOUNDARY
absorb                  particleBoundary
insulating              fieldBoundary

#PLANETRADIUS
1.5e5                   radius [m] = body radius

#SOLVEEM
F                       solveEM

#HYBRIDPIC
T                       useHybridPIC

#HALLTERM
F                       useHallTerm

#RESISTIVITY
0.0                     etaResistivity

#ELECTRONTEMPERATURE
0.0                     electronTemperature
1.0                     electronGamma
1.0                     electronDensity0

#BSUBCYCLE
1                       nBSubcycle

#PLASMA
3                       nSpecies
0.0625                  mass        Species 0: fluid electron slot
-1.0                    charge
44.0                    mass        Species 1: corona ion
1.0                     charge
44.0                    mass        Species 2: layer ion (not produced)
1.0                     charge

#UNIFORMSTATE
1.0e-3                  rho [/cc]   Species 0
0.0                     ux
0.0                     uy
0.0                     uz
1.0                     T [K]
1.0e-3                  rho [/cc]   Species 1: seed (sets the mass unit)
0.0                     ux
0.0                     uy
0.0                     uz
1.0                     T [K]
1.0e-3                  rho [/cc]   Species 2
0.0                     ux
0.0                     uy
0.0                     uz
1.0                     T [K]
0.0                     bx
0.0                     by
0.0                     bz
0.0                     ex
0.0                     ey
0.0                     ez

#FIELDBOXBOUNDARY
outflow                 x-
outflow                 x+
outflow                 y-
outflow                 y+
outflow                 z-
outflow                 z+

#PARTICLEBOXBOUNDARY
outflow                 x-
outflow                 x+
outflow                 y-
outflow                 y+
outflow                 z-
outflow                 z+

#EXOSPHERE
Mixed                   typeProfile
2                       nComponent
Chamberlain             typeComponent   Component 0: corona
1.0e12                  n0 [m^-3] at the body surface
1.5e6                   H0 [m]  n = n0 exp(-H0 (1/R - 1/r)), local scale height 15 km at R
100.0                   T0 [K]
0.0                     k0
Exponential             typeComponent   Component 1: thin layer, not ionized
1.0e12                  n0 [m^-3] at the body surface
1000.0                  H0 [m]
100.0                   T0 [K]
0.0                     k0

#PHOTOIONIZATION
1.0e-3                  nuPhoto0 [1/s]  Component 0 -> species 1
0.0                     nuPhoto0 [1/s]  Component 1 -> species 2

#OPTICALDEPTH
0.0                     crossSection [m^2]   corona: transparent
1.0e-20                 crossSection [m^2]   thin layer: column <= 1e-5
-1                      scaleHeight [m]
-1                      scaleHeight [m]
1.0                     solarDirX
0.0                     solarDirY
0.0                     solarDirZ
F                       chapmanFunction
1.0e-10                 minProduction
0.0                     tauFloor
11.5                    tauCutoff
5.0e-4                  cosSzaFloor

#SOURCE
T                       useSource

#TIMESTEPPING
T                       useFixedDt
0.1                     dt

#PARTICLES
2                       npcelx
2                       npcely
2                       npcelz

#SOURCEPARTICLES
1                       npcelx
1                       npcely
1                       npcelz

#MONITOR
50                      dnReport
100                     dnReportLB
T                       doCompact

#SAVELOG
1                       dnSavePic
1                       dnSavePT

#STOP
4                       MaxIter
-1.0                    TimeMax
